00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:59.290
Because we battle against some
of the most incredible chefs

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.123
on the planet.

00:01:00.123 --> 00:01:02.180
Some have three Michelin
stars, you know, I mean

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.653
they're really intensely good chefs.

00:01:04.653 --> 00:01:06.845
It's a different show because,

00:01:06.845 --> 00:01:08.783
well, of course the Iron Chefs are new,

00:01:08.783 --> 00:01:12.260
and there's just a lot more going on.

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.813
There's new hosts and there's,

00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:17.270
it's a really fun, fun show.

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:20.700
- I love that you're saying
it's not so much as competitive

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.611
