00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.063
they'd be like,

00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:27.896
you don't wanna run
against the slower person,

00:01:27.896 --> 00:01:29.020
you want to run against
someone that's fast

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:29.853
that makes you better.

00:01:29.853 --> 00:01:30.956
So is that kind of cool

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:31.789
when y'all get in an environment together,

00:01:31.789 --> 00:01:33.170
do you just kind of feed off of each other

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.260
